Build infrastructure for systematic parameter sweeps.

## Goal
Create tooling to run grid searches over strategy parameters.

## Parameters to Sweep
- spread: {1, 2, 3, 4, 5} bps
- skew: {0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0}
- samples: {3000, 5000, 7000, 10000}
- buygap: {3, 5, 7, 10} bps
- comfort: {10, 20, 30, 40} %
- window: {20m, 42m, 60m, 120m}

## Output Format
- CSV with all parameters + metrics
- Heatmaps for 2D parameter interactions
- Best parameter set per dataset/coin

## Implementation
- Parallel execution (current test.sh pattern)
- Results aggregation and storage
- Visualization scripts